      "id": "c51efa3a-4634-4c2d-afa6-3a5414d614e9",
      "title": "Drawer with pull · Cut and fit",
      "notes": "Dry-fit the five panels square with the front and back between the sides and the bottom under the walls. Confirm the 0.51563 in side gap on each side against the delivered slides. Check mounting faces, screw length and bottom attachment before drilling. Center the 96 mm Liberty bar pull on the box front. Mark the holes with the delivered pull or its template, and verify screw reach through every front layer before drilling. The motion check includes the pull's full clearance envelope. Check the installed pull, hand access and surrounding trim.",
